The awkward `_SBI` suffix in DEF_ADDRS_PER_INODE_SBI(sbi) was introduced because
DEF_ADDRS_PER_INODE(inode) was already defined in include/linux/f2fs_fs.h using
the kernel VFS helper i_blocksize(inode).

