+ * Arguments are never decoded. The NULL procedure gets an empty success and
+ * SET/UNSET get TRUE, for both RPCBVERS_2 and RPCBVERS_4. v4 has to be
+ * answered because __svc_rpcb_register6() turns a v4 refusal into
